              "text": "ডুব দেওয়া — ḍub deoyā — \"to take a dip; to dive under\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "গরমে অরুণ পুকুরে ডুব দিল। gôrôme ôrun pukure ḍub dilô. In the heat Arun took a dip in the pond."
            },
