              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি পুকুরে ডুব দিলেন, tini pukure ḍub dilen."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ডুব is a plunge under water; ডোবা, to sink, is the same root."
            }
          ]
        },
